notes.content:
ORR Early Access Release has been delayed one month. To apologize for the delay and to celebrate the Halloween release, a secret spooky level will be included. The race will be at night, under a full moon. An abandoned graveyard sits off in the distance. Who knows what horrors the night might hold.

{spoiler below}
























It's zombies, but can you find the secret to make them rise from the dead.
